":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421439006:1":{"text":"지난번 순찰 때, 하인들이 친척인 척해서 빠져나갔어요. 그 뒤론 다시 떵떵거리며 잘만 살고 있다고요!","source_cn":"之前卫队巡查时，他谎称他们是亲戚，躲过风头之后就继续美...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2C2414DB20DD46C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421439007:1":{"text":"오, 그래? 고맙군. 이런 비밀을 공유해주다니, 잘 기억해두도록 하지.","source_cn":"哦？这样啊，谢谢你为我分享这个小秘密，我会为你保守它的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB69E2076A16B9116","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421439008:1":{"text":"...하, 하지만, 그... 포상이라던가...","source_cn":"……可、可是，可是，我是说，奖励或者——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40682CAE6A40D825","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421439009:1":{"text":"방금 내가 말하지 않았나? 나는 이제 통치자가 아니야. 하지만 그대는 이런 나를 믿고 비밀을 털어놓았지.","source_cn":"我已经说过了吧？我已经被解职了，而你告诉我这个珍藏的秘...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC55257E45CCD65F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421439010:1":{"text":"그 믿음을 배신하지 않을 테니 날 믿어도 좋아.","source_cn":"那么我就不会辜负你的信任，相信我的承诺吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D1F0D0ED1DD6DD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_